  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "having it off shows jaggys and sharp unpleasant lines on any avatar or world that has thin or sharp shapes/lines on it turning anti aliasing on 2x drops fps and doesn't even look good doing so it over blurs everything especially hair on avatars i suggest a few things \n\n1 add newer better anti aliasing\n\n2 allow driver based anti aliasing to work in vrchat preferably along with all the other driver based features almost every other game allows you to use \n\n3 allow 2 separate anti aliasing options in the graphics menu 1 for worlds 1 for avatars even better would be 2 separate graphic menus 1 for worlds and 1 for avatars",
